  "prefLabel": "En 902.25 Member",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 902.25 “Member” means a customer of the same distribution utility as the host, who signs an agreement to be a member of a group under RSA 362-A:9, XIV(a), or who is enrolled in an EAP LMI project as outlined in RSA 362-A:9, XIV(f), who remains a customer of the same distribution utility as the host during its membership in the group, and, with the exception of a political subdivision, as defined in RSA 362-A:1-a, II-c, or the owner of a facility described in RSA 362-A:9, XX, who is not a customer-generator.\n\nSource. #14568, eff 4-27-26, EXPIRES: 4-27-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en900.html"
